(text "Rev A power.\nJ2 is the 5 V charge contact. D1 blocks a reversed charger.\nU1 charges a single LiPo to 4.20 V at 100 mA (R1 = 10k, I = 1000 V / Rprog).\nVBAT feeds the module VDDH pin. Do not tie VBAT to a 3.3 V-only rail: a full cell is 4.2 V.\nVDD is the module REG0 output. Set UICR.REGOUT0 to 3.3 V (value 5). The erased default is 1.8 V.\nU2 makes 1.8 V for the MAX30102 digital supply only. PPG LEDs use VBAT.\nCHG_STAT is the charger open-drain status, pulled up to VDD." (at 40 140 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)))
  (uuid edd02b7d-4146-42e6-b512-cc2f4076d009)
)

  (sheet_instances (path "/a1b2c3d4-1111-4111-8111-111111111111/b1b2c3d4-2222-4222-8222-222222222222" (page "2")))
